t battery, exposed mains voltage or an unidentified short. Identify pump noise, blockage, bubbles, leakage, RPM and radiator orientation. Do not guess pinouts, firmware files or electrical limits. stepEn: Confirm the exact model, part number, board revision and firmware version.','Kontrola,układu,chłodzenia,cieczą,AIO,Chłodzenie,AIO',''),
